OL,3,GNEWSA'No jobs on a dead planet' -
OL,4,Aex-commissioner defends helping scrap
OL,5,AM4 relief road
OL,6,
OL,7,FA former independent commissioner says
OL,8,Fshe helped scrap the M4 relief road
OL,9,Fover concerns about the environment
OL,10,Fbecause "there are no jobs on a dead
OL,11,Fplanet".
OL,13,FSophie Howe made the comment on a BBC
OL,14,Fpodcast after it was suggested the
OL,15,Fcancelled 14-mile motorway in Newport
OL,16,Fcould have helped boost the economy.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,433,430,260,140,0,100
