OL,3,GNEWSA'No jobs on a dead planet' -
OL,4,Aex-commissioner defends helping scrap
OL,5,AM4 relief road
OL,6,
OL,7,FHowe, who was the world's first future
OL,8,Fgenerations commissioner, also
OL,9,Fdescribed helping get dozens of other
OL,10,Froad projects cancelled including a
OL,11,Fthird Menai crossing over concerns
OL,12,Fabout the environment and wellbeing.
OL,14,FThe Welsh government said it was
OL,15,Freviewing options for the M4 around
OL,16,FNewport, after the previous Labour
OL,17,Fgovernment under Mark Drakeford had
OL,18,Fscrapped plans for a relief road in
OL,19,F2019.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
